            "review_text": "whoiskazza\nSingapore, Singapore10 contributions\n0\nSumptuous Vietnam food that arouse your senses\nJul 2013\nDishes ordered: steamed prawns in coconut, lemongrass steamed clams, fried pork intestines, special beef noodles soup, rice paper spring rolls. Although stuffed... had to have their desserts because it's different. Will be coming back the next time I'm back in HCM.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 17, 2013",
