            "review_text": "kate h\nJan Juc, Australia15 contributions\n0\nAmazing food service lacklustre\nJun 2013 • Business\nWe ate here twice recently as the food was so tasty although the service a bit average with hidden costs added to our bill for hand cloths and an appetizer that was on the table when we arrived. We refused to pay for appetizer. Also despite white wine everywhere in restaurant didnt appear to be in fridge and the staff didnt understand it needs to be served cold! However food is worth it we shared chicken wings spicy and calamari and mixed rice, must go to Hue as spices etc very yum. Atmosphere nice and very clean. Check it out.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 8, 2013",
