            "review_text": "Hien N\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam74 contributions\n0\nPricey place for average food\nMay 2013\nI passed by this restaurant and in hunger for dessert, I decided to give this restaurant a try even though I usually avoid restaurant locate on nice spot of the city, they usually pricey and offer not nice food. We order 2 dessert and after sitting for awhile, we are informed that one of our choice is finished and they asked us to choose different dish. It takes a while for the food to be served, which is ok for me, that could mean they cook it when we order and that also explain why the other dessert is not available. \n\nThe dessert r not nice, slightly at the average. For Hue food, there r much better quality and value restaurant, not so far away (around ben thanh market).\n\nService is slow \n\nI would never come back here.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 19, 2013",
